    "title": "Police investigate after food delivery driver assaulted, robbed in Howard County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By MEGHAN CURTIS ,\n8 hours ago HOWARD COUNTY, Md. (WBFF) — Howard County Police are investigating after a food delivery driver was assaulted and robbed Wednesday night. Shortly before 11 p.m. on Sept. 30, authorities said a man reported that he was delivering food in the 7100 block of Talisman Lane in Columbia when two males approached him. Read full article\n2",
